Package: cid-listener
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Caller ID driver for Sistemler CID V6 device
 Userspace driver for the Sistemler CID V6 USB Caller ID device.
 Monitors all 4 analog phone lines and emits Caller ID data as JSON.
 .
 Features:
  - Supports all 4 phone lines simultaneously
  - European V.23 FSK demodulation (ETSI CLIP)
  - JSON output for easy integration
  - Raw audio capture option
